                "description": "The Regular Double Cylinder Deadbolt will fit most pre-drilled doors. It will fit doors with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets with thicknesses ranging from 1-3/8 inches to 3 inches. This is a double cylinder deadbolt so the latch is thrown and retracted by key on the interior and exterior.",
